      "seq_in_parent": 1,
      "type": "prose",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "关羽镇守荆州。关羽闻知曹操退兵，关羽遂引兵取襄阳。关羽此来，曹操大惊。",
      "char_count": 35
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0005:c01",
      "parent_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0005",
      "seq_in_parent": 1,
      "type": "prose",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "瑾曰：“特来求结两家之好……请君侯思之。”云长勃然大怒曰：“吾虎女安肯嫁犬子乎！……”",
      "char_count": 43
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0006:c01",
      "parent_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0006",
      "seq_in_parent": 1,
      "type": "verse",
      "role": "lead",
      "text": "后人有诗赞曰：",
      "char_count": 7
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0006:c02",
      "parent_id": "sanguo-yanyi:0073:p0006",
      "seq_in_parent": 2,
      "type": "verse",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "赤壁楼船扫地空，片帆先渡大江东。",
